  "body": "<h1>NBA DFS Rankings for Sunday, November 1 (DraftKings)</h1>\n<p class=\"meta\">DraftKings main slate · <strong>Sunday, November 1</strong> · 4 games · First game 3:30 PM ET · By <strong>Chris Spags</strong> · <!--@@SLATE-PUBLISHED@@--> · Numbers as of <time datetime=\"2026-11-01T20:48:55-05:00\">November 1, 8:48 PM ET</time></p>\n<p>Luka Doncic (LAL) ranks first on the Sunday, November 1 DraftKings main slate at 56.7 projected DraftKings points for $12,300. Jayson Tatum (BOS, 49.8) and Scottie Barnes (TOR, 45.3) are next.</p>\n<p>The table ranks the top 100 of 101 players in the run by SPAGS projection, with DraftKings salary and projected points per $1,000.</p>\n<p>Every projection is a SPAGS model estimate from the November 1, 8:48 PM ET run of the Splash Play NBA model. This page updates each time the main-slate numbers are run, and NBA projections move with every injury report, so check the time above before you build.</p>\n<!-- SLOT:OFFER-TOP -->\n<!--@@SLATE-OFFER@@-->\n<style>@media(max-width:480px){.tw.nb th,.tw.nb td{padding-left:5px!important;padding-right:5px!important}.tw.nb th:first-child,.tw.nb td:first-child{padding-left:9px!important}}</style>\n<h2>DraftKings rankings by projection, Nov 1</h2>\n<div class=\"tw nb\"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Player</th><th>Salary</th><th>SPAGS proj</th><th>Pts/$1K</th><th>Pos</th><th>Team</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/luka-doncic/\">Luka Doncic</a></td><td>$12,300</td><td class=\"num\">56.7</td><td class=\"num\">4.61</td><td>PG</td><td>LAL</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/jayson-tatum/\">Jayson Tatum</a></td><td>$10,100</td><td class=\"num\">49.8</td><td class=\"num\">4.93</td><td>SF/PF</td><td>BOS</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/players/scottie-barnes/\">Scottie Barnes</a></td><td>$8,700</td><td class=\"num\">45.3</td><td class=\"num\">5.21</td><td>SF/PF</td><td>TOR</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><td><a href=\"/dfs/nba/player